# Unselected Unicode16 default str.lower equality for Windows drive spelling.
# This is NOT normcase/casefold/normalization. Native seen-path normcase uses
# Windows LCMapStringEx separately. Inputs are validated UTF-8 byte spans.
# Data are immutable source literals, not runtime files or mutable/global maps.
# Mechanically imported Unicode16 simple-lower187 records, Cased159 ranges,
# Case_Ignorable452 ranges. Default full-lower overrides: U0130 and Final_Sigma.
# UnicodeData FF58E5823BD095166564A006E47D111130813DCF8BF234EF79FA51A870EDB48F
# SpecialCasing 8D5DE354EEF79F2395A54C9C7DCEBBAF3D30FC962D0F85611EA97AA973A0C451
# DerivedCoreProperties 39D35161F2954497F69E08BDB9E701493F476A3D30222DE20028FEDA36C1DABD
# https://www.unicode.org/Public/16.0.0/ucd/
